A few minutes later, another order arrives.
I take a deep breath.
I start to make my second coffee.
My first coffee had gone completely wrong.
But I am now learning to operate the machine properly.
Sunita stands behind me.
This time I pay close attention.
I complete all the steps carefully.
I take some milk in the cup.
I place that milk in the right place under the machine.
This time the milk does not get too hot.
It heats up perfectly.
I pour the coffee into the cup.
The color of this second coffee looks very nice.
A perfect foam has come on it.
The drink now looks much better.
Sunita looks at the coffee and smiles.
"Wow, this coffee has turned out perfectly!" she says happily.
I have now learned to make good coffee.
I take that cup in my hand with satisfaction.
